	(descr "Waveshare ESP32-C5-Zero-M (pre-soldered 2.54 mm headers) plugged into two 1x9 2.54 mm female sockets, rows 15.24 mm apart. Pin 1 is 1.59 mm from the USB-C end (esp32-c5-zero-Size.pdf). The module sits ~11 mm above the board: the courtyard covers only the two socket strips, so low parts may go under the module. The antenna end keeps a copper and footprint keep-out.")
